      "message": "I’m concerned that adding universal owners might blur product boundaries and dilute team accountability. Generally, if an issue arises, the standard workflow of filing a bug for the specific team to triage ensures the right experts handle the fix. Could you provide a specific use case where universal lead ownership is necessary? Understanding the gap this fills might help us find a more targeted solution.",
