      "side": 1,
      "message": "It was meant to be similar to a sheriffs override.  Since this exists within the EC repo, having an EC lead override when things are broken and blocking or when something similar comes up seems reasonable.\n\nIt doesn\u0027t give everyone the ability to do it, but a small subset of the team",
